    "text": "\ud83d\udfe1Heavy Rain Watch \ud83d\udfe1\n\nA new Heavy Rain Watch has been issued for the Bay of Plenty area west of Kawerau. It is valid for 8 hours between 7am and 3pm today, Thursday the 13th of August.\n\nPeriods of heavy rain are expected, with localised downpours possible. \n\nmetservice.com/warnings/home",
